<title>THAILAND: Bangkok Metropolitan first half net plunges.</title>
<headline>Bangkok Metropolitan first half net plunges.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Audited financial results for the first six months ending June 30, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>				     Six months</p>
<p>				   1996			1995</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		 0.52     vs	     1.15</p>
<p>    Net			438.09     vs	   822.75</p>
<p>Note: Second quarter figures not stated. Company's full name is Bangkok Metropolitan Bank Plc.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom 662-252-9950, 652-0642</p>
